# mid-length proof job (8.5 min): commit only the inputs the runner needs.
# 8.5 min is ~110 shots, which fits the Pexels 200 req/hour free cap; a 27-min
# film needs ~350 shots and would spend 2-5 HOURS just sourcing.
!work/night/
